<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Urologix rated attractive.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Urologix rated attractive.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber analyst Charles Olsziewski initiated coverage of Urologix Inc with an attractive rating, according to a PaineWebber source.</p>
<p>-- analyst not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- shares closed at 16-3/4 Friday.</p>
